# What this does not prove: no OFX host, so the context and queue are ones the
# spike made itself rather than the host's (kOfxImageEffectPropOpenCLCommandQueue);
# no GPU, so the timings would say nothing even if it printed any; and the tree
# under .validation/cl is dpkg -x output, not an installed system.
